Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 07:18:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 7/9] axon7: touch key disabler on AIDL vendor.lineage.touch

The HIDL vendor.lineage.touch@1.0 service becomes
vendor.lineage.touch-service.axon7 on the NDK backend of
vendor.lineage.touch V1. Same Synaptics 0dbutton node.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FVN6i1nM3y1ifpqjS4n7PW
